<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed, defineAsyncComponent, ref } from 'vue'
import { Sprout, Waves, House, RefreshCw, Layers, CloudRain, ScanLine, BookOpen, Info, ExternalLink } from '@lucide/vue'
import AgricultureChart from '../components/AgricultureChart.vue'
import { useAgriculture } from '../composables/useAgriculture'
import { apiUrl } from '../agriculture/api'
import { explorerUrl } from '../data/site'
import '../styles/agriculture.css'

const AgricultureMap = defineAsyncComponent(() => import('../components/AgricultureMap.vue'))
const { summary, geometry, changes, vegetation, rainfall, selectedProvince, selected, reload, loadCharts } = useAgriculture()
const crop = ref<'pure' | 'mixed'>('pure'), metric = ref<'radar' | 'rainfall'>('radar'), vegetationIndex = ref<'ndvi' | 'evi'>('ndvi')
const currentCrop = computed(() => selected.value?.[crop.value])
const ranked = computed(() => [...(summary.data?.provinces ?? [])].sort((a, b) => (b[crop.value].changedPercent ?? -1) - (a[crop.value].changedPercent ?? -1)))
const threshold = computed(() => changes.data?.find((r) => r.province === selectedProvince.value && r.cropClass === (crop.value === 'pure' ? 12 : 14))?.thresholdDb)
const vegetationRows = computed(() => (vegetation.data ?? []).map((r) => ({ date: r.date, value: r[vegetationIndex.value] })))
const rainfallRows = computed(() => (rainfall.data ?? []).map((r) => ({ date: r.date, value: r.rainfallMm, reference: r.referenceMm })))
const vegetationSources = computed(() => [...new Set(vegetation.data?.map((r) => r.source))].join(', '))
const rainfallSources = computed(() => [...new Set(rainfall.data?.map((r) => r.source))].join(', '))
const coverage = computed(() => [...new Set(vegetation.data?.map((r) => r.coverageStatus))].join(', '))
const coveragePercent = computed(() => { const c = currentCrop.value; return c?.areaHa && c.validHa !== null ? c.validHa / c.areaHa * 100 : null })
const number = (v: number | null | undefined, decimals = 0) => v === null || v === undefined ? 'Not supplied' : v.toLocaleString('en', { maximumFractionDigits: decimals })
const date = (v: string) => new Date(`${v}T00:00:00Z`).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'short', year: 'numeric', timeZone: 'UTC' })
const apiDocs = computed(() => { try { return apiUrl('/docs') } catch { return null } })
</script>

<template>
  <div class="agriculture">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#ag-main">Skip to agriculture evidence</a>
    <header class="ag-header"><a class="ag-brand" href="/" aria-label="Cambodia Agriculture Explorer home"><span><Sprout :size="25" /></span><div>CAMBODIA<small>AGRICULTURE EXPLORER</small></div></a><nav aria-label="Explorer navigation"><a href="/"><House :size="16" /><span>Home</span></a><a :href="explorerUrl"><Waves :size="16" /><span>Flood explorer</span></a><a href="#ag-sources"><BookOpen :size="16" /><span>Sources</span></a></nav></header>
    <main id="ag-main" class="ag-main" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="ag-intro" aria-labelledby="ag-title"><div><p class="ag-eyebrow">FIELD NOTES / 02 · AGRICULTURE</p><h1 id="ag-title">A closer look at<br /><em>the land that feeds us.</em></h1><p>Follow cropland radar changes, rainfall and vegetation around Tonlé Sap. Select a province and read the evidence behind each signal.</p></div><div class="ag-intro-meta"><span class="ag-tag"><span />TEAM API · UNREVIEWED ANALYSIS</span><p>{{ summary.data?.region ?? 'Tonlé Sap region, Cambodia' }}</p><button class="ag-button" :disabled="summary.loading" @click="reload"><RefreshCw :size="14" :class="{ 'ag-spin': summary.loading }" />Refresh data</button></div></section>
      <div class="ag-disclaimer"><Info :size="17" /><p>Radar change is a signal to investigate. It does not confirm crop damage, yield loss or a particular cause. Dataset dates and coverage differ.</p></div>
      <div v-if="summary.loading" class="ag-loading" role="status">Loading agriculture data from the team API…</div>
      <div v-else-if="summary.error" class="ag-error" role="alert"><h2>Agriculture data could not be loaded.</h2><p>{{ summary.error }}</p><button class="ag-button" @click="reload">Try again</button><a :href="explorerUrl">Open the flood explorer</a></div>
      <template v-else-if="summary.data && selected">
        <section class="ag-workbench" aria-label="Province agriculture overview">
          <div class="ag-toolbar"><label class="ag-select-label">Study province<select v-model="selectedProvince" aria-label="Study province"><option v-for="p in summary.data.provinces" :key="p.province" :value="p.province">{{ p.province }}</option></select></label><div class="ag-segment" role="group" aria-label="Cropland class"><button :aria-pressed="crop === 'pure'" @click="crop = 'pure'">Pure cropland</button><button :aria-pressed="crop === 'mixed'" @click="crop = 'mixed'">Mixed cropland</button></div><span class="ag-period"><ScanLine :size="15" />{{ date(summary.data.comparison.before) }} → {{ date(summary.data.comparison.after) }}</span></div>
          <div class="ag-overview-grid"><section class="ag-map-panel" aria-labelledby="ag-map-title"><div class="ag-panel-heading"><div><p class="ag-eyebrow">SIX PROVINCES / ONE CONNECTED LANDSCAPE</p><h2 id="ag-map-title">{{ metric === 'radar' ? 'Where radar measurements changed' : 'Where rainfall differs from the reference' }}</h2></div><div class="ag-segment" role="group" aria-label="Map measurement"><button :aria-pressed="metric === 'radar'" @click="metric = 'radar'"><Layers :size="14" />Radar change</button><button :aria-pressed="metric === 'rainfall'" @click="metric = 'rainfall'"><CloudRain :size="14" />Rainfall</button></div></div>
            <p v-if="geometry.loading" class="ag-loading" role="status">Loading province boundaries…</p><div v-else-if="geometry.error" class="ag-empty" role="status"><p>Map boundaries unavailable: {{ geometry.error }}</p><p>Use the province selector and table to explore the available figures.</p><button class="ag-button" @click="reload">Retry map data</button></div><AgricultureMap v-else-if="geometry.data" :geometry="geometry.data" :summary="summary.data" :selected="selectedProvince" :crop="crop" :metric="metric" @select="selectedProvince = $event" />
            <p class="ag-map-caption">{{ metric === 'radar' ? `Change percentage uses valid radar-covered ${crop} cropland as its denominator. Colours summarize provinces; they do not locate individual changed fields.` : `Monthly rainfall anomaly for ${date(selected.rainfallDate)}. Positive means wetter than the supplied reference; negative means drier. Reference period needs confirmation.` }}</p>
          </section>
          <aside class="ag-province-panel" aria-labelledby="ag-province-title"><p class="ag-eyebrow">SELECTED PROVINCE</p><h2 id="ag-province-title">{{ selected.province }}</h2><p class="ag-class-label">{{ crop === 'pure' ? 'Pure cropland · class 12' : 'Mixed cropland · class 14' }}</p><div class="ag-main-stat"><span>Radar-change signal</span><strong>{{ number(currentCrop?.changedPercent, 1) }}<small v-if="currentCrop?.changedPercent != null">%</small></strong><p>of valid radar-covered cropland</p></div><dl class="ag-stat-list"><div><dt>Area showing change</dt><dd>{{ number(currentCrop?.changedHa) }}<small v-if="currentCrop?.changedHa != null"> ha</small></dd></div><div><dt>Valid radar coverage</dt><dd>{{ number(currentCrop?.validHa) }}<small v-if="currentCrop?.validHa != null"> ha</small></dd></div><div><dt>Total class area</dt><dd>{{ number(currentCrop?.areaHa) }}<small v-if="currentCrop?.areaHa != null"> ha</small></dd></div></dl><div class="ag-coverage"><span>Radar coverage of this class</span><strong>{{ number(coveragePercent, 1) }}{{ coveragePercent !== null ? '%' : '' }}</strong><div class="ag-coverage-track" aria-hidden="true"><span :style="{ width: `${Math.min(coveragePercent ?? 0, 100)}%` }" /></div></div><p class="ag-method-note">{{ changes.loading ? 'Loading change method…' : threshold != null ? `Reported change threshold: ${number(threshold, 1)} dB. Direction and processing details need team review.` : 'Change threshold not supplied for this selection.' }}</p><p v-if="changes.error" class="ag-method-note" role="status">Method metadata unavailable: {{ changes.error }}</p></aside>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="ag-chart-grid" aria-label="Rainfall and vegetation context">
          <article class="ag-chart-panel"><div class="ag-panel-heading"><div><p class="ag-eyebrow">RAINFALL CONTEXT / MONTHLY</p><h2>Rainfall through the seasons</h2></div><CloudRain :size="24" /></div><p class="ag-chart-description">{{ selected.province }} · monthly rainfall and the API’s reference average.</p><p v-if="rainfall.loading" class="ag-loading" role="status">Loading rainfall…</p><div v-else-if="rainfall.error" class="ag-empty" role="status"><p>{{ rainfall.error }}</p><button class="ag-button" @click="loadCharts">Retry charts</button></div><template v-else-if="rainfall.data?.length"><AgricultureChart title="Monthly rainfall" unit="mm" :rows="rainfallRows" reference-label="Reference average" /><p class="ag-source-line">Source: {{ rainfallSources }} · reference period not provided.</p></template><p v-else class="ag-empty">No rainfall records are available for {{ selected.province }}.</p></article>
          <article class="ag-chart-panel"><div class="ag-panel-heading"><div><p class="ag-eyebrow">VEGETATION CONTEXT / SEPARATE DATES</p><h2>Following vegetation greenness</h2></div><div class="ag-segment" role="group" aria-label="Vegetation index"><button :aria-pressed="vegetationIndex === 'ndvi'" @click="vegetationIndex = 'ndvi'">NDVI</button><button :aria-pressed="vegetationIndex === 'evi'" @click="vegetationIndex = 'evi'">EVI</button></div></div><p class="ag-chart-description">{{ selected.province }} · {{ vegetationIndex.toUpperCase() }} is a vegetation index, not a direct measure of crop yield.</p><p v-if="vegetation.loading" class="ag-loading" role="status">Loading vegetation…</p><div v-else-if="vegetation.error" class="ag-empty" role="status"><p>{{ vegetation.error }}</p><button class="ag-button" @click="loadCharts">Retry charts</button></div><template v-else-if="vegetation.data?.length"><p class="ag-sample-note">Coverage: {{ coverage }}. {{ date(vegetation.data[0]!.date) }}–{{ date(vegetation.data.at(-1)!.date) }}. Compare only matching periods. Historical samples cannot explain later radar changes.</p><AgricultureChart :title="vegetationIndex.toUpperCase()" unit="index" :rows="vegetationRows" /><p class="ag-source-line">Source: {{ vegetationSources }}. Quality filtering, cropland masking and aggregation need confirmation.</p><details class="ag-values"><summary>View vegetation sampling coverage</summary><div class="ag-table-scroll"><table><caption>Valid pixels and coverage reported by the API</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Valid pixels</th><th scope="col">Coverage</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in vegetation.data" :key="r.date"><th scope="row">{{ r.date }}</th><td>{{ number(r.validPixels) }}</td><td>{{ r.coverageStatus }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></template><p v-else class="ag-empty">No vegetation records are available for {{ selected.province }}. Radar and rainfall remain available.</p></article>
        </section>
        <section class="ag-ranking" aria-labelledby="ag-ranking-title"><div class="ag-panel-heading"><div><p class="ag-eyebrow">COMPARE THE REGION</p><h2 id="ag-ranking-title">Province radar-change signals</h2></div><span>{{ crop === 'pure' ? 'Pure cropland' : 'Mixed cropland' }} · highest percentage first</span></div><div class="ag-table-scroll"><table><caption>Team-reported radar change. Percentages are relative to valid radar-covered class area, not the whole province.</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Province</th><th scope="col">Change signal</th><th scope="col">Changed area (ha)</th><th scope="col">Valid radar area (ha)</th><th scope="col">Class area (ha)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="p in ranked" :key="p.province" :class="{ 'is-selected': p.province === selectedProvince }"><th scope="row"><button :aria-pressed="p.province === selectedProvince" @click="selectedProvince = p.province">{{ p.province }}</button></th><td>{{ number(p[crop].changedPercent, 1) }}{{ p[crop].changedPercent !== null ? '%' : '' }}</td><td>{{ number(p[crop].changedHa) }}</td><td>{{ number(p[crop].validHa) }}</td><td>{{ number(p[crop].areaHa) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
      </template>
      <section id="ag-sources" class="ag-evidence" aria-labelledby="ag-evidence-title"><div><p class="ag-eyebrow">READ THE EVIDENCE</p><h2 id="ag-evidence-title">Every signal needs context.</h2><p>This page displays team-provided API outputs. Serving a dataset successfully does not independently validate its processing or interpretation.</p><a v-if="apiDocs" :href="apiDocs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open API documentation<ExternalLink :size="14" /></a></div><div><details open><summary>Sources, dates & method</summary><p v-if="summary.data">NISAR comparison: {{ summary.data.comparison.before }} → {{ summary.data.comparison.after }}. Track {{ summary.data.comparison.track }}, frame {{ summary.data.comparison.frame }}, mode {{ summary.data.comparison.mode }}, reported polarization {{ summary.data.comparison.polarization }}. {{ summary.data.interpretation }}</p><p>Exact product identifiers, processing, valid masks and independent validation remain to be reviewed. “Pure” and “mixed” cropland are the backend’s land-cover categories; they do not identify individual rice fields. MODIS vegetation is supplementary optical context. Rainfall uses the source named beside its chart; do not assume every layer is NASA data.</p></details><details><summary>Coverage & unavailable features</summary><p>Coverage is limited to the six provinces supplied by the API. No forecast is displayed: the forecast endpoint was unavailable during integration, and no forecast method or validation has been reviewed.</p><p>Vegetation records carry their own coverage labels. Historical or partial samples do not demonstrate current crop health or explain a later radar change.</p><p v-if="summary.data?.status.modis_vegetation === 'pending_appeears'">The summary still reports vegetation as pending. Available samples are shown separately with their actual dates; this backend status needs reconciliation.</p></details><details v-if="summary.data"><summary>Backend processing status · reported</summary><dl class="ag-backend-status"><div v-for="(status, name) in summary.data.status" :key="name"><dt>{{ name }}</dt><dd>{{ status }}</dd></div></dl><p>These are backend-reported statuses, not independent frontend verification.</p></details></div></section>
    </main><footer class="ag-footer"><span>CAMBODIA / OUR CHANGING HOME</span><p>Independent hackathon project · no NASA endorsement implied.</p></footer>
  </div>
</template>
